        {
            "id": "3b97eb5d-2c35-4ee2-a718-e22e3775631b",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3237",
            "content": {
                "en": "I checked: the pilots are unharmed. For some reason, the puppeteer didn’t control them. Though they probably have no idea what just happened.",
                "zh": "我看了一下，飞行员们都没什么事儿。那个偶师不知为什么没有控制他们，不过他们大概也不清楚发生了什么。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2064.800048828125,
            "positionY": 217.59999084472657,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e1b9bbb9-ef65-46be-88a3-4d0e41f20a5f",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3238",
            "content": {
                "en": "Maybe the puppeteer didn’t know how to fly. Should we leave now? If we land like this, explaining everything will be hard.",
                "zh": "可能是偶师自己不会开飞机。我们先离开这里吧？如果在这个情况下到达机场，短时间内可能很难说清楚。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2383.199951171875,
            "positionY": 220.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "367c2e1d-14a7-4180-a370-132269edcff7",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3239",
            "content": {
                "en": "True! With the puppeteer gone, the controlled passengers should gradually recover. Things seem safe here now.",
                "zh": "也是！没了偶师，这些被控制的人应该慢慢就能缓回来。这边应该已经安全了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2713.599853515625,
            "positionY": 218.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
